  "name": "study 177, the blind draw and the map from nothing in one folder: A draws laws blind as 174 did, ten new batches of 1,000; the focus begins on the first law that scores here, the zone worker reading its neighbours and seeds (group N) and the depth worker pushing it alone up its ladder to half the host's memory (group D); nothing seeded, nothing imported",
  "question": "The operator's question (2026-10-13): can simple local rules make a graph grow a real dimension, like space; which keep one they are given; and can the null map predict a law before it runs? Study 169 is the first study on the final probes, the installed table and the deterministic fleet (800 to 806), run on 813, its data the first clean data (the operator, 2026-11-19 21:11: \"This way, we immediately have clean data from our latest codebase\").",
  "decided": {
    "why_now": "the operator, 2026-11-26 11:55: \"can we just start a new study from scratch first without any prior seeding at all, and just see the mechanism of the focus group and dev worker kick in automatically as the random drawer finds its first candidate that scores. And as soon as there is a single score value, then the dev worker should start pushing on the highest scoring one as high as it can. Meanwhile, the zone worker will try to expand the laws around it to see whether or not it's a lucky hit or a neighborhood\"; and: \"once the from scratch is confirmed running, then we want to test the functionality of [...] a data bundle from a previous study\"",
    "blind": "A is 174's design, as 176's, on ten new search seeds: the same grid, starts, ladder, budgets and gates, a batch of 1,000 laws each; its seeds are the ten blind ones 177 drew at 2026-11-26T11:05:28Z, never run",
    "focus": "the focus (operations/focus.py, resources/readings/focus_plan_1.json) is begun by the study's start: its three campaigns N (neighbours), S (seeds, group N) and D (depth) made at once, the first law taken the moment one scores, nothing to press; the depth worker one law at a time, the law in focus first, to half the host's memory (881)",
    "seed": "the seeded campaign starts empty and draws nothing, and stays empty until the operator seeds it: the step after this study is confirmed running on its own (the operator, 11:55), so nothing is in the import folder at its start",
